WEBVTT

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:03.905
Here is how to get started with Multi Search Hub.

00:00:03.905 --> 00:00:08.068
Install the extension from the Chrome Web Store or Microsoft Edge

00:00:08.068 --> 00:00:11.095
Add-ons, using the links on our official website.

00:00:11.095 --> 00:00:14.123
Open the search window and type your topic.

00:00:14.123 --> 00:00:18.286
Choose a built-in group, then select the engines you want to

00:00:18.286 --> 00:00:22.449
include. Search web pages, images, or videos from one starting
point.

00:00:22.449 --> 00:00:25.477
Compatible sources appear in a combined results view.

00:00:25.477 --> 00:00:28.126
Other services open in their own tabs.

00:00:28.126 --> 00:00:32.289
Not every provider can be combined, and available results can
vary.

00:00:32.289 --> 00:00:36.453
Try the list and card layouts to see which suits your

00:00:36.453 --> 00:00:40.616
research. Open useful results at their original source, and check
their

00:00:40.616 --> 00:00:44.779
accuracy and usage rights. The free edition includes built-in
groups, source

00:00:44.779 --> 00:00:48.942
selection, themes, and core search. Combined results are capped
at fifteen

00:00:48.942 --> 00:00:53.105
per engine and sixty overall. Pro adds tools for repeat research:

00:00:53.105 --> 00:00:57.268
custom engines and groups, named presets, multi-group search, and
search history.

00:00:57.268 --> 00:00:59.917
Backup and restore help preserve your settings.

00:00:59.917 --> 00:01:02.567
Pro also includes optional encrypted saved sign-ins.

00:01:02.567 --> 00:01:06.730
Follow the guide for your master password and backups, and never

00:01:06.730 --> 00:01:10.893
share a license key publicly. Pro offers higher configurable
result limits,

00:01:10.893 --> 00:01:14.299
but the number available still depends on each provider.

00:01:14.299 --> 00:01:17.327
It is a one-time purchase, not a subscription.

00:01:17.327 --> 00:01:21.111
Check the current price and activation instructions on the
website.

00:01:21.111 --> 00:01:25.274
For your first search, pick a topic you know and compare

00:01:25.274 --> 00:01:28.302
a few sources. Then try another built-in group.

00:01:28.302 --> 00:01:32.465
If you keep choosing the same sources, explore Pro's presets and

00:01:32.465 --> 00:01:36.628
custom groups. Find the feature comparison, store links, and
step-by-step guides

00:01:36.628 --> 00:01:39.656
at multi search hub dot github dot io.

00:01:39.656 --> 00:01:41.170
Search once. Explore more.
